# Third-party notices

Nosolear's own code is MIT-licensed (see `LICENSE`). That licence covers only this
project's code. This repository ships no model weights, binaries or audio. Users install
or download the components below themselves, and each keeps its own licence.

Licences below were checked against the upstream sources on the date shown. Where a
component has a code licence and a separate weights licence, both are given.

## CrisperWhisper

Used only as an opt-in transcriber, never chosen by `auto`.

- Code: MIT (Nyra Health GmbH).
- Model weights (`nyralabs/CrisperWhisper`, formerly `nyrahealth/CrisperWhisper`):
  CC BY-NC 4.0. The upstream README says the weights are not MIT and are free for research
  and non-commercial use only; commercial use needs a licence from Nyra. The same README
  names a "Nyra Health Non-Commercial Research License" for the model weights.
- The MIT licence does not cover these weights. Enable CrisperWhisper only if your use is
  non-commercial. It is off unless you turn it on, because it is opt-in.

Pinned revision: `5a513ffabb3429bb61da3521c4e24fbd33ec3e7c` (`nyralabs/CrisperWhisper`, read
from the Hugging Face API on 2026-11-13). The Hub API reports this repo as not gated, so the
licence acceptance step in `ensure_model` is a precaution, not a gate. The upstream notice
says v1 is superseded by CrisperWhisper 2.0 (`nyralabs/CrisperWhisper2.0_large`), which is not
pinned here.

Source: https://huggingface.co/nyralabs/CrisperWhisper
Source: https://github.com/nyrahealth/CrisperWhisper/blob/main/LICENSE
Source: https://github.com/nyrahealth/CrisperWhisper#license
Verified: 2026-11-13

## espeak-ng

Used for phoneme output. It is a separate executable that you install (Homebrew, apt) and
that Nosolear runs as a subprocess. It is not linked, bundled or loaded as a library, and
the app does not use `phonemizer`, which loads libespeak-ng into the Python process.

- Licence: GPL-3.0 or later (upstream README: "GPL version 3 or later"). Latest release
  seen at verification: 1.52.0.

Source: https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng/blob/master/COPYING
Source: https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng#license-information
Verified: 2026-11-12

