`facebook/wav2vec2-lv-60-espeak-cv-ft` weights, downloaded from Hugging Face at a pinned
revision.

- Licence: Apache-2.0, as declared on the model card. The card does not state the licences
  of the Common Voice data or the base checkpoint it was fine-tuned from.

Pinned revision: `ae45363bf3413b374fecd9dc8bc1df0e24c3b7f4` (read from the Hugging Face API on
