Source: https://huggingface.co/facebook/wav2vec2-lv-60-espeak-cv-ft
Verified: 2026-11-13

## Whisper

Whisper weights as used by `mlx-whisper` and `faster-whisper`, downloaded at pinned
revisions. Defaults: `whisper-large-v3-turbo` on MLX, `small.en` on faster-whisper.

- OpenAI Whisper code and `openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo`: MIT.
- `Systran/faster-whisper-small.en` (faster-whisper): MIT, as declared on the model card.
- `mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo` (MLX): the model card declares no licence. It is
  a conversion of OpenAI's `large-v3-turbo`, which is MIT.

